// Reason a radiology_admin closed out an imaging request without producing a
// report file. Covers the "patient never came / no scan will ever happen"
// cases that the normal upload→complete flow can't terminate. `patient_no_show`
// maps the request status to `no_show`; every other reason maps it to
// `cancelled` while recording WHY for departmental reporting.
enum ImagingClosureReason {
  patient_no_show       @map("patient_no_show")
  patient_refused       @map("patient_refused")
  patient_cancelled     @map("patient_cancelled")
  done_externally       @map("done_externally")
